{"step_index":635,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-18T01:48:09Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-18T10:48:09+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-18T10:48:12+09:00\nThe search for \"\"010-3227-1759\" OR (\"에이치앤제이\" \"부산\" \"캐릭터\")\" returned the following summary:\n검색 결과, 문의하신 전화번호 \"010-3227-1759\"와 직접적으로 연관된 정보는 확인되지 않았습니다 [1.2.1-1.2.9].\n\n또한, 부산 지역의 \"에이치앤제이\"라는 상호를 가진 업체는 여러 곳이 검색되나[1][2][3], \"캐릭터\" 사업과 명확하게 연결되는 특정 업체에 대한 정보는 찾기 어려웠습니다[4][5].\n\n더 정확한 정보를 확인하시려면 해당 업체의 공식 홈페이지나 관련 소셜 미디어 채널을 다시 한번 확인해 보시는 것을 권장합니다.\n\nSources:\n[1] [hankyung.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH7OLCerRh1iG7QSnptYpPFIsMRj_H5H2EmMACMJ_xAPA0zdNh_FQjLY7Zi32HZEwhZJIIagHiKHZ4f3jfenkch8oNq_ruihktit8SokflcjMGsD2OebQCupbZPpiDjeq4j9ng=)\n[2] [investing.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFt4QMp9hHhvqZqn4hI2e1sngCYoRWHR2j3xB0OlDLEyTw8B4-1nTGNBHe1ONSWOPjyraqZLiD2z2PrRXg0yc07eHXSUgXw2lWh8irsDOmetO0G6fNTetjuenopgeSk6EtHuZV4usxjjjg=)\n[3] [tistory.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGp3WBzNWH3uw67uLvqQIJagMlRsGFbX9w2kQ8_Y53bDQsB5taNhFtX3HIqEV_A09gSR5XNKkeomXUCTvVNIPlb9uHzz07lhRP8yHvmYkscnVlSM1b-fls=)\n[4] [jobkorea.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFOBsPNv2sLMwcn3HQUujpZsLxcnMkzpEuQTK2ZDSy2Fz05-hyEooAm-v9P4XkAgp7LJrU5WMBPb-_GiCokbLrYeabGx7decIlLlezdD_8g5gWHSUnxny-6Z9GWVsHrpCTQAhIV9DntvGL5rw7uskIQmdbzM3FI66ryDCjQnBdWlz_qHIM18Z8E2VN3fK4ON5j5mpjhQmVkmrIQzDL5IQ==)\n[5] [visitkorea.or.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFzPhNauARNvfUTWHqG5dKud07w_P8a4JwIjz5Ka4nmlQeeRwB2nj7pX_upa9tPKkq4dCSeRePwe3IYvRoIVJPFNqC-fgQ8vB2twQhBNFVVkZq2qyapL15Ppd8sdKE5NcnL7cGqYSqq483nCVsm2OhDq_GEdcXonww_Ot2nlhEgERnjZXpNY65w5gq5d4dS_w==)"}
